			"date": "2025-09-10T17:53:44.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> It gets interesting when you combine `hyphens: auto` and `word-break` haha: <a href=\"https://sunny.garden/@knowler/113964937944456245\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">sunny.garden/@knowler/11396493</span><span class=\"invisible\">7944456245</span></a></p>",
