				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/292/532/015/873/530/original/b119a0914bbd5722.jpg"
			},
			"date": "2025-09-12T18:18:28.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> </p><p>I believe the headline is outside the webview, so it's a choice they made in writing the ObjC/Swift UI (or someone at Apple made the choice, for them).</p>",
